OL,3,ADemocrats nominate Hakeem Jeffries to
OL,4,Abe US Speaker of the House
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis election to the powerful position -
OL,7,Fthe Speaker is in the line of
OL,8,Fsuccession to the presidency after the
OL,9,Fvice-president - is widely expected.
